      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering Key Management**\n\nI'm currently focused on selecting a managed key service provider for the Python script. Google Cloud KMS is a strong contender, and I will be integrating provider identification within the code. I am leaning toward the KMS, considering its strengths and resources.\n\n\n**Implementing Encryption Workflow**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud KMS and have started building the `encrypt_payload.py` script. The function will accept project ID, location, keyring, key name, and the plaintext. I am ready to use the KMS client library for encryption, making sure to include `google.cloud.kms_v1` for provider identification. The next step is coding the encryption functionality.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864492642,
          "start": 1789864490540
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc3cb62c001YEefHNYtabAQeB",
